menu "Gateway C6"

    config GW_C6_WAKEUP_GPIO
        int "Time pulse GPIO (the WAKEUP line to the P4)"
        default 2
        range 0 30
        help
            C6 pin of the line to the P4 that carries the time pulse: a rising
            edge every SURROUND_TIME_INTERVAL_MS (125 ms). On the FireBeetle 2
            ESP32-P4 and the ESP32-P4 Function EV board this is GPIO2 of the C6,
            wired to GPIO6 of the P4. ESP-Hosted host power save must stay off
            on both sides, so ESP-Hosted never drives this line.

endmenu
